---@param h integer
---@param format GL? (Default: `GL.RGBA`)
---@return (number|number[])[] colors Column of color values (color size based on format), indexed by row.
---@see [LuaOpenGL.cpp#L6861-L6870](https://github.com/beyond-all-reason/RecoilEngine/blob/a3b76d53ee/rts/Lua/LuaOpenGL.cpp#L6861-L6870)
